; This repository has no `@cloudflare/*` dependency today. This file
; exists so that if a future dep pulls in an `@cloudflare/*` scope, the
; resolver forces it to the public npm registry — no private mirror
; can silently supply the package. Removing this file is safe as long
; as no `@cloudflare/*` dep is ever introduced; if you add one, ensure
; the equivalent scope pin still exists somewhere in the toolchain.
@cloudflare:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
